        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The 30 years from Einstein's annus mirabilis (1905) to the stabilization of quantum field theory produced the two frameworks that replaced Newtonian mechanics. Neither was anticipated from within the prior framework. Both required abandoning commonsense assumptions about space, time, and measurement."
    },
    {
